DESCRIPTION:--------\nPurpose:\n--------\n\nThe primary purpose of this dis
 cussion is to help you get to know the other learners in the class and bec
 ome familiar with how to post to discussion forums (for those who might be
  new to this).\n\n \n\n-----------\nAssignment:\n-----------\n\nFor this 
 discussion\,  introduce yourself in writing to your instructor and your f
 ellow classmates. \n\nYour Initial Post should be at least 200 words an
 d is due before 11:59 p.m. on Tuesday.\n\n*\n\nTell us where home is\, and
  what your plan is at Iowa Western Community College. \n\n*\n\nTell us if
  you have any hobbies and a unique thing about yourself that will help us 
 remember you.\n\n*\n\nAlso let us know what you would like to be called in
  class. \n\nYou will also need to make two Reply Posts of 100 words e
 ach (2x100 words) to classmates before 11:59 p.m. on Sunday. \n\n \n\n--
 --------------------\nEvaluation and Grading\n----------------------\n\nPl
 ease refer to the attached rubric.\n\n[screenshot of rubric button in canv
 as] (https://classes.iwcc.edu/courses/28753/files/5635215/preview)\n\n 
