CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Let's get to know each other! Please answer the following quest
 ions:\n\n* What is your preferred name?\n\n* Where did you grow up?\n\n* W
 hat do you want to be when you "grow up?"\n\n* What's one fun fact about y
 ourself?\n\nPlease create three questions for your fellow students to resp
 ond to with the following guidelines:\n\n* One True or False question.\n\n
 * One question that can be answered with a number (don't ask what is your 
 favorite number).\n\n* One question that requires a short answer.\n\nDo no
 t repeat questions that have already been asked.\n\nFor attendance\, pleas
 e submit your responses by the end of the day on Tuesday at 11:59 PM. By S
 unday at 11:59 PM\, respond to at least three classmates by answering thei
 r questions.\n\nOne final note: If there is anything you need me to know t
 hat you are not comfortable posting publicly to the class\, please email m
 e with that information.\n\nJustin Miller\n[jemiller@iwcc.edu] (mailto:jem
 iller@iwcc.edu)
