  the following questions:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>What is your preferred name?</li>
 \n<li>Where did you grow up?</li>\n<li>What do you want to be when you "gr
 ow up?"</li>\n<li>What's one fun fact about yourself?</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Plea
 se create three questions for your fellow students to respond to with the 
 following guidelines:</p>\n<ol style="list-style-type: decimal\;">\n<li>On
 e True or False question.</li>\n<li>One question that can be answered with
  a number (don't ask what is your favorite number).</li>\n<li>One question
  that requires a short answer.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Do not repeat questions tha
 t have already been asked.</p>\n<p>For attendance\, please submit your res
 ponses by the end of the day on Tuesday at 11:59 PM. By Sunday at 11:59 PM
