DTSTART;VALUE=DATE;VALUE=DATE:20260113
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Week 1 here is a place for our weekly discussion\, q
 uestions\, and tips.\n\nThis week is mostly about getting familiar with th
 e online learning environment.  Our course is in Canvas which is where yo
 u are right now with the discussion board etc. then our course content inc
 luding reading\, labs\, assignments etc. are located in Cengage MindTap wh
 ich can be accessed through link in Modules.\n\nI have setup our course in
  MindTap so you will need this as part of your required material\, see thi
 s week's announcement for more details on Cengage.  There is more materia
 l available than what is due that counts towards your grade.  I highly en
 courage you to take advantage of the additional material not just the grad
 ed items to get the most from the class.  \n\n \n\nFor our discussion t
 his week let's start off this week with introductions including name\, any
  Linux experience\, experience with Canvas and Cengage MindTap for classes
 \, and anything random you'd like to share with class.
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Week 1 - Welcome Discussion [26/SP NET-418-OL01]
URL;VALUE=URI:https://classes.iwcc.edu/calendar?include_contexts=course_269
 55&month=01&year=2026#assignment_805725
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>Welcome to Week 1 here is a place for our w
 eekly discussion\, questions\, and tips.</p>\n<p>This week is mostly about
  getting familiar with the online learning environment.&nbsp\; Our course 
 is in Canvas which is where you are right now with the discussion board et
 c. then our course content including reading\, labs\, assignments etc. are
  located in Cengage MindTap which can be accessed through link in Modules.
 </p>\n<p>I have setup our course in MindTap so you will need this as part 
 of your required material\, see this week's announcement for more details 
 on Cengage.&nbsp\; There is more material available than what is due that 
 counts towards your grade.&nbsp\; I highly encourage you to take advantage
  of the additional material not just the graded items to get the most from
  the class.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p>\n<p>&nbsp\;</p>\n<p><span>For our discussion
  this week let's start off this week with introductions including name\, a
 ny Linux experience\, experience with Canvas and Cengage MindTap for class
 es\, and anything random you'd like to share with class.</span></p>
END:VEVENT
