DESCRIPTION:I will give you 10 bonus points if you add your picture to your
  Canvas profile. It makes it easier for me to remember who you are when I 
 have a face to connect to your name. It has to be a picture of YOU! Not of
  your pet or something else you are interested in. \n\nInstructions on ho
 w to add picture:\n\n* Click on Account in the top left corner\n\n* Click 
 on Profile\n\n* Click on Circle where Picture will go\n\nTo receive the bo
 nus points the picture needs to be added by 11:59 pm on August 24. I will 
 check to see if a picture has been added and give you the points. 
