UID:event-assignment-802384
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE;VALUE=DATE:20260118
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Please use this discussion board to introduce yourself to the c
 lass and to become acquainted with each other through the week!  I would 
 like to hear about your academic goals\, professional goals and your ex
 perience to date (good and bad) with Internet courses. \n\nAfter reviewin
 g the learning objectives of this course in the class syllabus\, list one 
 thing that you would like to cover in this course. \n\nIf you would attac
 h a picture of yourself or something else that interests you\, I would app
 reciate that too. The purpose of this assignment is to give you an opportu
 nity to get to know some of the other students in this class and for them 
 (and me\, your instructor) to get to know you.\n\nTo post to this forum cl
 icking on the forum title\, then click Reply and type your name as the sub
 ject.  You can click on "preview" to read over your message to catch any 
 errors before submitting. Once you submit your response\, Canvas posts you
 r message and records your name as well as the date and time. Also feel f
 ree and respond to other students’ postings.\n\nThis is a graded assignm
 ent and it’s worth 100%.
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Getting to Know You [26/SP NET-313-OL01]
URL;VALUE=URI:https://classes.iwcc.edu/calendar?include_contexts=course_269
 57&month=01&year=2026#assignment_802384
