 style="font-family: 'inherit'\,serif\;">Please use this discussion board t
 o introduce yourself to the class and to become acquainted with each other
  through the week!&nbsp\; I would like to hear&nbsp\;about your&nbsp\;acad
 emic&nbsp\;goals\, professional goals and your experience to date (good an
 d bad) with Internet courses.&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="margin: 0in 0in
  12.0pt 0in\;"><span style="font-family: 'inherit'\,serif\;">After reviewi
 ng the learning objectives of this course in the class syllabus\, list one
  thing that you would like to cover in this course.&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p 
 style="margin: 0in 0in 12.0pt 0in\;"><span style="font-family: 'inherit'\,
 serif\;">If you would attach a picture of yourself or something else that 
 interests you\, I would appreciate that too. The purpose of this assignmen
 t is to give you an opportunity to get to know some of the other students 
 in this class and for them (and me\, your instructor) to get to know you.<
 /span></p>\n<p style="margin: 0in 0in 12.0pt 0in\;"><span style="font-fami
 ly: 'inherit'\,serif\;">To post to this forum clicking on the forum title\
