 rtant\, even if other fault tolerant storage technologies (e.g.\, RAID) ar
 e used"?\n\nRead Chapter 7\, research\, think and learn more on the topic.
  This is a 3-part assignment (1 new thread and 2 replies)\, and all 3 part
 s will be considered for grading.\n\nProofreading counts as part of the as
 signment grade\; points will be deducted for spelling and grammar errors. 
