 iscussion Posting and Grading Criteria\n\nInitial discussion post (8 sente
 nces)\n\n60% of overall credit\n\n2 replies to two other students (5 sente
 nces each) 30% each\n\n30% of overall credit\n\nGrammar/spelling\n\n10% of
