 ottom of the screen when you have completed your response.  If you click
  Save Draft\, your message cannot be viewed by the instructor or other s
 tudents.\n\n* As other students post their opinions\, read through the for
 um\, and respond to at least two other messages by clicking Reply to th
 e student's post\, and Post Reply.  The first couple of students who po
 st messages may have to check back later to post their
