DESCRIPTION:All discussions must be submitted every Sunday at 6:00 p.m. (th
 is includes original postings and replies) for attendance purposes.\n\nT
 his discussion activity will include creating a new discussion board threa
 d.\n\nDiscuss "Which method of remote access (VPN or RDP) is an organizati
 on more likely to choose if they deploy corporate-owned laptops to employe
 es\, and why"?\n\nRead chapter 9\, research\, think and learn more about a
 dvanced storage.  This is a 3-part assignment (1 new thread and 2 replies
 )\, and all 3 parts will be considered for grading.\n\nProofreading counts
  as part of the assignment grade\; points will be deducted for spelling an
 d grammar errors. Be specific -- details are important. Your entry should 
 be substantive and meaningful. Include the full working URL of any online 
 sources used.\n\nDiscussion Posting and Grading Criteria\n\nInitial discus
 sion post (8 sentences)\n\n60% of overall credit\n\n2 replies to two other
  students (5 sentences each) 30% each\n\n30% of overall credit\n\nGrammar/
 spelling\n\n10% of overall credit\n\nTo submit your responses to the quest
 ions\, follow the steps below:\n\n* Click Reply at the bottom\, and post 
 your responses to both questions in the same thread.  Be sure to click Po
 st Reply at the bottom of the screen when you have completed your respons
 e.  If you click Save Draft\, your message cannot be viewed by the inst
 ructor or other students.\n\n* As other students post their opinions\, rea
 d through the forum\, and respond to at least two other messages by clic
 king Reply to the student's post\, and Post Reply.  The first couple o
 f students who post messages may have to check back later to post their re
 plies.
