 rong></span></p><p>This discussion activity will include creating a new di
 scussion board thread.</p><p>Discuss "<strong>how public key cryptography 
 works to protect the symmetric keys that are used to protect data."</stron
 g></p><p>Read chapter 11\, research\, think and learn more about public ke
 y cryptography.&nbsp\; This is a 3-part assignment (1 new thread and 2 rep
 lies)\, and all 3 parts will be considered for grading.</p><p>Proofreading
  counts as part of the assignment grade\; points will be deducted for spel
 ling and grammar errors. Be specific -- details are important. Your entry 
